'''Aim for that Hill''' (Japanese: '''あの丘をめざして''' ''Ano Oka wo Mezashite'') is one of the opening songs of the Japanese [[Pikachu short]]s.

It debuted in ''[[PK11|Camp Pikachu]]''.

==Synopsis==

==Characters==
